## Alex [ORCHESTRATION RESEARCH COMPLETE] 2025-01-27 - Backend Orchestration Patterns Research Complete

**Type:** RESEARCH  
**Track:** Backend, Orchestration  
**Related Systems:** All Backend Systems, Orchestration Patterns  
